    "The recording list in this page schema reflects exactly the verified state of the catalogue: four tracks, “GENKIDAMA”, “BIG BAG”, “RAKITA” and “HOT #Oups 5”. Where the established artist profiles on this site list eight to fifteen tracks, this one lists four, because four is the true number as of 20 October 2026. If FLW publishes an album, a biography or new tracks, this profile will be expanded and dated, like every page on this site.",
    "In the meantime, listening begins with “GENKIDAMA”, the official video with <a href=\"/en/diixly.html\">Diixly</a>, continues with “BIG BAG”, the single under his name of 20 January 2026, then with the collective tracks “RAKITA” and “HOT #Oups 5”, before placing the whole in this site <a href=\"/en/playlist-bouyon.html\">bouyon playlist</a>. FLW appears there for what he is in the public record: the T-BTS voice of a French Caribbean collective, documented by four tracks, no more, no less."
